•	12. Validation Screen Behaviour
•	User Input
•	
•	The following fields should be available:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Business Unit
•	 
•	Function
•	 
•	Business Line
•	 
•	Market
•	 
•	Account
•	 
•	Alternate Account
•	 
•	Affiliate
•	 
•	Project ID
•	 
•	Book Code
•	Not Mandatory
•	
•	Users are NOT required to enter all fields.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Valid use case:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Account = 40025
•	Project = blank
•	 
•	Validate
•	
•	System should still process.
•	
•	Validation Logic
•	
•	When Validate is clicked:
•	
•	Step 1
•	
•	Identify applicable rules.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	ACT_PROJ
•	 
•	requires:
•	 
•	Account
•	Project
•	
•	If user has entered:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Business Unit only
•	
•	Then:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	No applicable validation rule found.
•	Step 2
•	
•	Skip irrelevant rules.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Rule:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	FCT_BL_MKT
•	
•	requires:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Function
•	Business Line
•	Market
•	
•	User entered:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Market only
•	
•	Rule should NOT be evaluated.
•	
•	Step 3
•	
•	Evaluate only applicable rules.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Account=40020
•	 
•	Project=blank
•	
•	Evaluate:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	ACT_PROJ
•	
•	Result:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	INVALID
•	13. AI Usage Optimization
•	Critical Requirement
•	
•	AI should NOT be called for every validation request.
•	
•	Validation Priority
•	Level 1
•	
•	Local Rule Engine
•	
•	Always execute first.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Validate Combination
•	
•	↓
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Read combinationRules.json
•	
•	↓
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Determine valid / invalid
•	
•	↓
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Return result
•	
•	No AI call.
•	
•	AI Trigger Conditions
•	
•	AI should only be called for:
•	
•	Condition 1
•	
•	User clicks
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Explain Result
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Why is this invalid?
•	Condition 2
•	
•	User asks free-form questions.
•	
•	Examples:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	What does Book Code R mean?
•	 
•	Explain ACT_PROJ.
•	 
•	What chartfields normally go with Account 40020?
•	Condition 3
•	
•	No matching rule found locally.
•	
•	Example:
•	
•	Plain Text
•	Very unusual combination.
•	 
•	No matching rule exists.
•	
•	System can ask AI for guidance.
•	
•	Do Not Call AI For
•	
•	❌ Standard validation
•	
•	❌ Tree lookup
•	
•	❌ ChartField definitions
•	
•	❌ Terminology lookup
•	
•	❌ Account hierarchy display
•	
•	❌ Market hierarchy display
•	
•	These should all come from local JSON configuration.
